@startuml
title EKA-18 built path — local tools retain access without LAN exposure
actor Developer
participant "Dev Compose" as Compose
database "PostgreSQL\n127.0.0.1:5432" as DB
participant "Redis\n127.0.0.1:6379" as Redis
participant "API container" as API

Developer -> Compose : docker compose up -d
Compose -> DB : publish IPv4 loopback only
Compose -> Redis : publish IPv4 loopback only
Developer -> DB : migrations/seeds via localhost
Developer -> Redis : local tooling via localhost
API -> DB : service DNS db:5432
API -> Redis : service DNS redis:6379
@enduml

@startuml
title EKA-13 path — monitor restart authority crosses host Docker boundary
participant "Monitor" as Monitor
participant "docker-proxy\nmutable latest" as Proxy
database "Host Docker daemon" as Docker
participant "Allowed service container" as Service
participant "Other net_ekklesia peer" as Peer

Monitor -> Monitor : AUTO_RECOVERY_T2 + client allowlist
Monitor -> Proxy : Docker SDK /version, containers.get, restart
Peer -> Proxy : same unauthenticated network path
Proxy -> Docker : Docker API via mounted socket
Docker -> Service : restart / inspect / allowed namespace action

note over Proxy
Next narrow fix changes provenance only:
official release tag + manifest digest.
Capabilities and reachability remain separate open work.
end note
@enduml
